data.value:
Hi, I am Corvi, your performance advisor. I run on your PC, no internet needed.

I can:
• optimize your PC for a game or genre (FPS, MOBA, TPS): name the game, I set the parameters, you only accept or adjust;
• explain any parameter and show where it is;
• assess risks and pick a profile.

Nothing is applied on its own: changes wait for your "Apply". I answer in the language of your question.
